  "hidden_hypotheses": "CFC uniqueness requires StarOrderedRing plus restricted-real selfadjoint CFC, nonnegative spectrum/topology/module contracts; available internally on COMPLEX bounded operators, not assumed on bare REAL operator algebra. Complex L2 complete for arbitrary μ; no finite measure/dimension/Nontrivial.",
  "planned_route_at_most_seven": [
    "Use canonical60 positive complex lifts Ac,Bc of given positive real A,B, with literal formulas/intertwining on same μ.",
    "Derive exact real/imaginary projection identities of lifted outputs from canonical ofReal/re/im quotient maps; reconstruct g=ιRg+iιQg on entire complex L2.",
    "Using these formulas and A²=B², prove Ac²=Bc² on ALL complex L2; no density-only argument, extra energy premise or caller preservation.",
    "Construct the same proof-local complex/restricted-real CFC instances as actual61; convert Ac/Bc positivity to operator nonnegativity.",
    "Apply CFC.mul_self_eq_mul_self_iff (or sqrt_unique twice) to deduce Ac=Bc without assuming real CFC or prior real uniqueness.",
    "Intertwining on every embedded u and canonical Rι=I imply A=B by real operator extensionality.",
    "After parent61 admission, consume its genuine S/T/D/Γ/energy under exact original binders; for each Γprime positive with same square, apply generic uniqueness to Γprime/Γ. Test original-input sameD uniqueness; no caller energy."
  ],
  "false_paths": [
    "Do not instantiate all-real CFC as a public hypothesis or treat restricted-real scalar calculus on complex algebra as bare-real operator CFC.",
    "Do not derive A=B from square equality without BOTH positive hypotheses: A=I,B=-I is counterexample on nonzero real Hilbert space.",
    "Pointwise conjugation is not operator adjoint, and commutation is not a public premise.",
    "Finite Euclidean E is not finite-dimensional L2; no finite eigenbasis fallback or Nontrivial restriction.",
    "Do not use actual62 uniqueness to prove generic62 uniqueness or parent61 descent; circular.",
    "No full-space inverse: actual D annihilates canonical constant; αη=1 and rank0 remain legal."
  ],
